<hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">L.</hi> 1 § 22 <hi rendition="#i">de tutelae</hi> (27. 3.)<lb/>
&#x201E;ut quis dicat <hi rendition="#i">plures esse ac-<lb/>
